  "scientific_hypothesis": "Changing the existing sigma_y0 parameter modulates the rate at which the dynamically relaxed lateral tire-slip state alpha' approaches instantaneous kinematic slip alpha during transient steering (d alpha / dt != 0). In sustained steady state (d alpha / dt ~ 0), alpha' approaches alpha, leaving sustained peak lateral force (Dy = mu_y * Fz) unaltered. Therefore, transient tracking should improve while sustained apex behavior remains non-inferior.",
